agm-0982: AGM H6 Wi-Fi step 2 (bsd/dev/agm_wcn_sipc.c): once the WCN firmware is up, SIPC over
the mailbox (0x641c0000/0x641d0000, WCN = core 8, polled) and the smem pool (0x87240000, CP 0x240000):
sbuf channels 5 (log), 11 (loopcheck), 12 (assert) and the sblock Wi-Fi command channel 7; sends
WIFI_CMD_SYNC_VERSION and prints the answer, the firmware's log and asserts.

